#: ../../source/docs/common-yaapu-gcs.rst:5 df4d766760cd460393977917198eee7d
msgid "Yaapu FrSky GCS using FrSky Bi-Directional Telemetry"
msgstr "**I2C**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yaapu-gcs.rst:7 09331a1a15b846eea3b827fe0c34da84
msgid ""
"ArduPilot now has the capability of not only displaying downlink telemetry "
"data from the autopilot via FrSky telemetry (see :ref:`common-frsky-"
"telemetry` )for display on an OpenTX compatible transmitter, but also the "
"ability to request and change parameters and send a few commands to the "
"autopilot."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 现在不仅能通过 FrSky 数传（见 :ref:`common-frsky-telemetry`）把飞控的下行数传数据显示在 "
"OpenTX 兼容遥控器上，还能请求和修改参数，并向飞控发送若干命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yaapu-gcs.rst:10 fea981936ba941d1ad9af9fe1bfc40d4
msgid "Taranis Display Example"
msgstr "I2C_SDA"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yaapu-gcs.rst:16 856d2339b50541be99bdb4efdbca9165
msgid "QX7 Display Example"
msgstr "**CAN1&CAN2**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yaapu-gcs.rst:22 3b8783dc8bdf4c8d8190b8473a5390fc
msgid "Horus/T16 Example"
msgstr "CAN_P"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yaapu-gcs.rst:29 8c98218dbaef4cb8985a9a67c86e7187
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "CAN_N"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yaapu-gcs.rst:31 644cca4f64674ed3876cf1deec1c3bd2
msgid ""
"In order to use this ability, you will need to setup the Yaapu LUAGCS script"
" on your OpenTX transmitter.  The Yaapu Telemetry script,if you are using "
"that also, will be paused when running this script. However, status messages"
" and telemetry info will still be displayed on Horus style transmitters, but"
" only battery voltage is shown on the Taranis class transmitters."
msgstr ""
"要使用此功能，需要在 OpenTX 遥控器上安装 Yaapu LUAGCS 脚本。如果你同时也在用 Yaapu "
"数传脚本，它会在本脚本运行期间暂停。不过在 Horus 类遥控器上仍会显示状态消息和数传信息，而 Taranis 类遥控器上只显示电池电压。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yaapu-gcs.rst:33 d029ef4fd15a4b07b0a2210449be00ac
msgid ""
"Once the Yaapu LUACGS script is exited, then other scripts, like the Yaapu "
"Telemetry script will restart."
msgstr "退出 Yaapu LUACGS 脚本后，其他脚本（如 Yaapu 数传脚本）会重新启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yaapu-gcs.rst:35 87aafc0f148c49538c61726b8ace79f6
msgid ""
"Which parameters will be displayed can easily be changed in the script and "
"parameter screens can be applied globally, by vehicle types, and/or by "
"individual model."
msgstr "要显示哪些参数可以在脚本里轻松修改，参数页面可以全局应用、按载具类型应用，和/或按单个机型应用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yaapu-gcs.rst:37 aafa2409dbd144efae9163d166606720
msgid ""
"Support for Taranis/QX7/Horus/T16 class OpenTx transmitters is provided."
msgstr "支持 Taranis/QX7/Horus/T16 级别的 OpenTx 遥控器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yaapu-gcs.rst:40 92572dded6b64ba78f2f9eaf72d8b0d9
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "UART_TX1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yaapu-gcs.rst:42 602b7fff8b9a4e1b9fb0ba8103c2c4ae
msgid ""
"Complete instructions are given on the `Yaapu LUAGCS Wiki "
"<https://github.com/yaapu/FrskyLuaGCS/wiki>`_ . Support questions can be "
"posted `here <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/frsky-bidirectional-telemetry-"
"implementation>`_ ."
msgstr ""
"完整说明见 `Yaapu LUAGCS Wiki <https://github.com/yaapu/FrskyLuaGCS/wiki>`_ "
"。支持类问题可发到 `这里 <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/frsky-bidirectional-"
"telemetry-implementation>`_ 。"
